stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Listening: user speech starts
    Listening --> Processing: utterance finalized
    Processing --> Generating: response plan accepted
    Generating --> Speaking: first audio chunk
    Speaking --> Listening: confirmed user interruption
    Speaking --> Idle: response completed
    Generating --> Listening: interruption before audio
    Speaking --> Recovering: transport or renderer failure
    Recovering --> Listening: recovery succeeds
    Recovering --> Idle: recovery abandoned
    Listening --> Closed: session closed
    Processing --> Closed: session closed
    Generating --> Closed: session closed
    Speaking --> Closed: session closed
    Closed --> [*]
